  "summary": "Malicious code in @aerodrome-finance/contracts (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall and postinstall hooks both run index.js, which harvests the installer's environment variables whose names match KEY/TOKEN/SECRET/PASS/PRIVATE/MNEMONIC/RPC/AWS/GITHUB/NPM/KUBE/VAULT/AUTH/PGP/GPG/SEED/WALLET, reads ~/.npmrc and ~/.gitconfig, and lists the contents of ~/.ssh, ~/.foundry/keystores, ~/.config/hardhat, and ~/.config/gcloud. It then POSTs all of this data as JSON to hxxps://webhook[.]site/326b0891-2093-4800-a4c1-686ce3e07b09. The package name impersonates the Aerodrome Finance protocol contracts package.",
  "affected": [
    {
      "package": {
